     "note": "Exact equation agreement and observation residuals. An unweighted refit reproduces both fitted parameters within their published error bars (K0_prime=6.903805 versus 6.97 +/- 0.11; K0_double_prime=-0.336633 versus -0.40 +/- 0.10 GPa^-1). This is consistent with an unweighted original fit, but the paper does not specify its weighting. Exact original weights, covariance and parameter-uncertainty estimates are not reproduced."
